{"id":"n16246-4-8","stage":3,"title":"선 · 限度","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16246-4-8-1","ko":"지수한테 너무 심한 농담을 들어서 기분이 나빴어.","zh":"听到智秀开的那些太过分的玩笑，我心情很不好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수한테","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"지수한테","audio":"/audio/8193d62d9944d3738746.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수한테","audio":"/audio/8193d62d9944d3738746.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"심한","meaning":"严重","explanation":"심하다：严重；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"심한","audio":"/audio/cd43d42638d16dea3a13.mp3"}},{"text":"농담을","meaning":"笑话，戏言，闹着玩儿","explanation":"농담：笑话，戏言，闹着玩儿；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"농담","audio":"/audio/9683003985125a24b9d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43805","senseId":"1","lemma":"농담","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"농담을","audio":"/audio/8cf23b81e28912a0c44d.mp3"}},{"text":"들어서","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"1","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어서","audio":"/audio/1958524b05c63f4d1762.mp3"}},{"text":"기분이","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20192","senseId":"1","lemma":"기분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기분이","audio":"/audio/2c7d19f699b942f8cc0b.mp3"}},{"text":"나빴어.","meaning":"糟糕，不好","explanation":"나쁘다：糟糕，不好；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나쁘다","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26816","senseId":"2","lemma":"나쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나빴어","audio":"/audio/7a20ca2e0b03d4f9b294.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"a1212e5a4cc18554","term":"심하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3","entryId":"65046","definition":"程度过头。","pronunciation":["심ː하다"]},{"id":"9683003985125a24","term":"농담","zh":"笑话，戏言，闹着玩儿","audio":"/audio/9683003985125a24b9d3.mp3","entryId":"43805","definition":"开别人玩笑的话或搞笑的话。","pronunciation":["농ː담"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"用耳朵接受声音。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"ebafc4e98d6e15e7","term":"기분","zh":"心情","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3","entryId":"20192","definition":"不快、愉快、忧郁、愤怒等的情感状态。","pronunciation":["기분"]},{"id":"b67c592bde724aa1","term":"나쁘다","zh":"糟糕，不好","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3","entryId":"26816","definition":"不称心或感觉不太好。","pronunciation":["나쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9842c9eb9c690a8096bb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16246-4-8-2","ko":"걔가 가끔 선을 넘는 장난을 칠 때가 있어.","zh":"她偶尔会开一些越界的玩笑。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"걔가","meaning":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","explanation":"걔：“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"걔","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64369","senseId":"1","lemma":"걔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걔가","audio":"/audio/c02e4aa0cf2ebbee0bf1.mp3"}},{"text":"가끔","meaning":"偶尔，有时，时而，间或","explanation":"가끔：偶尔，有时，时而，间或","readings":[{"term":"가끔","audio":"/audio/712074afaec5737d4bcb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65204","senseId":"1","lemma":"가끔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가끔","audio":"/audio/712074afaec5737d4bcb.mp3"}},{"text":"선을","meaning":"限度，尺度，界限","explanation":"선：限度，尺度，界限；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"선","audio":"/audio/ca8a8225e4286f710068.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16246","senseId":"4","lemma":"선","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선을","audio":"/audio/3f056de9e28c534e1fc2.mp3"}},{"text":"넘는","meaning":"过，超过","explanation":"넘다：过，超过；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"넘다","audio":"/audio/bd8fe9471c90dfb81875.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64524","senseId":"4","lemma":"넘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넘는","audio":"/audio/4c97f1769d6ac65ea3f0.mp3"}},{"text":"장난을","meaning":"使坏，恶作剧，捣乱","explanation":"장난：使坏，恶作剧，捣乱；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"장난","audio":"/audio/4ecff0aab1862eb976b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24799","senseId":"3","lemma":"장난","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장난을","audio":"/audio/70627fffd3aa7796b5d3.mp3"}},{"text":"칠","meaning":"打，玩，抽","explanation":"치다：打，玩，抽；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","senseId":"4","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"칠","audio":"/audio/e8eb2f9b25b9fd2fe1b1.mp3"}},{"text":"때가","meaning":"时机，机会","explanation":"때：时机，机会；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"3","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때가","audio":"/audio/2794e832ef37e0b9c41c.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6488cd1503b8fc1c","term":"걔","zh":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3","entryId":"64369","definition":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"712074afaec5737d","term":"가끔","zh":"偶尔，有时，时而，间或","audio":"/audio/712074afaec5737d4bcb.mp3","entryId":"65204","definition":"不经常，偶然一次。","pronunciation":["가끔"]},{"id":"ca8a8225e4286f71","term":"선","zh":"限度，尺度，界限","audio":"/audio/ca8a8225e4286f710068.mp3","entryId":"16246","definition":"既定的标准或程度。","pronunciation":["선"]},{"id":"bd8fe9471c90dfb8","term":"넘다","zh":"过，超过","audio":"/audio/bd8fe9471c90dfb81875.mp3","entryId":"64524","definition":"超出一定的标准或限度。","pronunciation":["넘ː따"]},{"id":"4ecff0aab1862eb9","term":"장난","zh":"使坏，恶作剧，捣乱","audio":"/audio/4ecff0aab1862eb976b8.mp3","entryId":"24799","definition":"为了耍弄别人而干的坏事。","pronunciation":["장난"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"打，玩，抽","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"57323","definition":"用手或手持物品击打物体的游戏或运动。","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时机，机会","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"合适做某事的时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5c27ab1b77dfb99fa752.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.205,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16246","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"중급","day":109,"sequenceScore":2.8584,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听到智秀开的那些太过分的玩笑，我心情很不好。","她偶尔会开一些越界的玩笑。","济州岛的往返机票居然只要十万韩元？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听到智秀开的那些太过分的玩笑，我心情很不好。","她偶尔会开一些越界的玩笑。","济州岛的往返机票居然只要十万